# Wrangler's static-assets ignore file (gitignore syntax) — controls what
# gets uploaded and served from the "assets.directory" in wrangler.jsonc.
#
# SECURITY (2026-08): supabase/ and scripts/ must never be served as public
# assets — supabase/schema.sql contains every RLS policy, admin function
# definition, and plan/pricing business logic, and supabase/functions/
# contains edge function source. These were accidentally publicly served
# on GitHub Pages (see _config.yml) and are excluded here from day one on
# Cloudflare instead of being caught after the fact.

.git
.github
.DS_Store
supabase/
scripts/
README.md
_config.yml
wrangler.jsonc
*.py
*.sh
{assets/
